      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Don't hide the data; reframe it as a critical learning opportunity that demonstrates rigorous scientific methodology. Instead of focusing on the 5%, emphasize the *process*—detail the innovative techniques you employed and how the initial results provided crucial baseline data for future, more aggressive interventions. This shows the reviewers that you are data-driven, adaptive, and committed to iterative improvement, which is far more impressive than a single, perfect outcome.",
